 <metadata>
  <name>Whitefield Hills</name>
  <desc>So run along higher lane before turning left through a ginnel to Ringley Chase , run around posh fountain, then back to run right onto Ringley Drive then left onto Ringley Road,  then right again down Stand Lane. 
Turn Right onto Hollinhurst Road to cut the corner. then right on Radcliffe New Road for a little, teeny, tiny uphill bit.  Turn right again at the goats gate to run along Dales Lane, Higher Lane to return.</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Run Together Whitefield</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/44862010"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3288502130242278470"/>
 </metadata>
